WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Step 1: In Tantra open Connectors. Under Platform, open API Keys.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Step 2: Click Create API Key.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Step 3: Name it, for example RevOps agent. Leave the expiry empty so the key keeps working.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 4: Click Create Key.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Step 5: Copy the key with the copy icon. Tantra shows it once and keeps only a hashed copy.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Step 6: In your centre, paste it into Tantra API key.

7
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Step 7: Click Connect Tantra. The agent checks the key by reading your campaigns; it never sends on its own.
